decoration is a kind of decoration, as stated in the CN explanatory notes to Chapter 95, confer "products to be classified as festive articles must be of a decorative value (design and ornament)".
figurine is a kind of decoration, as stated in the CN explanatory notes to Chapter 95, confer "figurines decorated with festive outfits, representing seasonal themes or engaged in seasonal activities".
garland is a kind of decoration, as stated in the CN explanatory notes to Chapter 95, confer "products to be classified as festive articles must be of a decorative value (design and ornament)".
banner is a kind of decoration, as stated in the CN explanatory notes to Chapter 95, confer "printed paper decorations, which are associated with a particular festivity".
yard sign is a kind of decoration, as stated in ruling NY N340898, confer "The single-use item will be marketed and sold as a party decoration".

